✅ Jenkins / CI-CD (1–25)
✅ 1. Pipeline stuck in queue
👉 No executor / agent offline → check node status, labels, increase executors

✅ 2. Pipeline works locally but fails in Jenkins
👉 Env mismatch → check Java version, PATH, permissions

✅ 3. Git clone fails
👉 Wrong credentials or network → test git clone manually

✅ 4. Jenkins job triggers multiple times
👉 Duplicate webhooks → remove extra hooks

✅ 5. Docker build fails in Jenkins
👉 Dockerfile or daemon issue → run build manually

✅ 6. docker.sock permission denied
👉 Add Jenkins user to docker group → restart

✅ 7. Artifact missing in next stage
👉 Workspace change → use stash/unstash

✅ 8. Pipeline timeout
👉 Long-running step → increase timeout / optimize

✅ 9. Jenkins disk full
👉 Clean old builds, enable log rotation

✅ 10. Credentials not working
👉 Wrong credentialsId or binding issue

✅ 11. Agent not connecting
👉 SSH issue → check keys, network

✅ 12. Jenkins slow
👉 No caching → use parallel + optimize builds

✅ 13. Wrong branch deployed
👉 Validate branch name (env.BRANCH_NAME)

✅ 14. Build fails after plugin install
👉 Plugin conflict → rollback

✅ 15. Pipeline syntax error
